abstract: >-
  CUDA/C++ implementations and reproducibility scripts for lunar-orbit
  visibility simulation, approximate short-time-stacking dirty imaging,
  direct three-dimensional controls, multi-GPU execution, and the
  450-day accumulated-response experiment. Scientific input arrays are
  identified by checksums and are obtained separately.
